$ ONDAS - single SWASH template for Base_case.ipynb
$ Every option is set from the notebook. The bed (depth.bot) is written by
$ SwashModelWrapper_ondas (scripts/wrappers.py).
$
$ Options filled in from the notebook:
$   wave_type  'mono' (regular) or 'jonswap' (irregular)
$   Hs, Tp     wave height (m) and peak period (s)
$   H_regular  regular wave height, Hs / sqrt(2), same energy as the JONSWAP sea
$   jonswap_gamma  JONSWAP peak enhancement (3.3 is the standard value)
$   manning_n  bed friction, one Manning n for the whole profile
$   WL         still water level (m)
$
PROJECT 'Ondas' '{{ case_num }}'
$
SET LEVEL= {{ WL }}
SET DEPMIN= 0.01
$
MODE DYNanic ONED
COORD CARTesian
CGRID 0 0 0 {{ xlenc }} 0 {{ mxc }} 0
VERT 1
$
$ Bed, from the profile built in the notebook
INPGRID BOTTOM 0 0 0 {{ mxinp }} 0 {{ dxinp }} 0.0
READINP BOTTOM 1 'depth.bot' 1 0 FREE
$
INIT ZERO
$
$ Offshore forcing
{% if wave_type == 'mono' -%}
BOUNDCOND SIDE W CCW BTYPE WEAK CON REGULAR {{ H_regular }} {{ Tp }}
{% else -%}
BOUNd SHAPespec JONswap {{ jonswap_gamma }} SIG PEAK DSPR DEGR
$ JONSWAP sea with its bound long wave; 001500 = the series repeats after 1500 s
BOUNdcond SIDE W CCW BTYPE WEAK ADDBoundwave CON SPECTRUM {{ Hs }} {{ Tp }} 90 0 001500
{% endif -%}
BOU SIDE E CCW BTYPE RADIATION
SPON E 10
$
$ Physics
BREAK
FRIC MANNING {{ manning_n }}
$
$ Numerics (DEPMIN and TIMEI keep the reef and large-Hs cases stable)
NONHYDrostatic BOX 1. PREConditioner ILU
DISCRET UPW MOM
DISCRET UPW UMOM H NONE
DISCRET UPW WMOM H NONE
DISCRET CORR
TIMEI 0.05 0.3
$
$ Output
QUANTITY XP hexp=10
QUANT RUNUP delrp 0.01
CURVE 'line' 0 0 {{ xlenc }} {{ xlenc }} 0
TABLE 'line' HEAD 'output.tab' TSEC XP YP WATL OUTPUT 0 1 SEC
TABLE 'NOGRID' HEAD 'run.tab' TSEC RUNUP OUTPUT 0 1 SEC
$
TEST  1,0
COMPUTE 000000.000 {{ deltc }} SEC {{ tendc }}
STOP
